description=A working aquarium for Build 42. Three tanks - the original 20-litre Aquarium, a 200-litre Large Aquarium and a two-tile 400-litre Display Aquarium. Catch a fish with a rod, get it home while it is still alive, and it swims in the tank and stays yours: each fish is kept as its own saved item and comes back out the same fish. Or switch any empty tank to a dry habitat for a pet rat or mouse. Press V beside a tank for the aquarium wheel; everything is on the right-click menu too. Optional: with Fishing Overhaul BR by gadinho installed, 97 of his species swim in the Large and Display tanks. No dependencies and no Java. Beta build: Beta tools are included so you can try everything straight away; they will be removed once the beta ends.
